Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:34.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}And that is why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:36.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}I want to be at USC IYA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:38.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}My family cabinetry business was struggling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:40.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}with messy paper quotes and slow workflows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:41.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}I didn't just wait around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:42.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}I wrote the software
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:44.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}set up the CAD pipeline
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:45.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}and built the core infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.43,0:00:47.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}I'll learn to take real physical operations
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.43,0:00:49.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}and turn them into smooth automated systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:51.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}I don't just want to study tech
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:52.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}I want to build things that actually matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.23,0:00:53.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}Hi USC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:55.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}my name is Yash Patil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.19,0:00:56.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}and I'm ready to make things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.87,0:00:57.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}Fight on.
